{"id":"n5-093","title":"だれも～ないです (dare mo ~ nai desu)","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Express 'nobody' or 'no one' in a negative sentence.","longExplanation":"The grammar point だれも～ないです is used to express the idea of 'nobody' or 'no one' in a negative sentence. だれも is followed by the negative form of a verb or adjective, often using the polite ないです form.","formation":"だれも + Verb-negative form (ないです), だれも + い-Adjective-negative form (ないです), だれも + な-Adjective-negative form (じゃないです)","examples":[{"jp":"だれも知らないです。","romaji":"Daremo shiranai desu.","en":"Nobody knows.","words":[{"surface":"だれ","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"知ら","vocabId":"1420470","reading":"しる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"だれも来ないです。","romaji":"Daremo konai desu.","en":"Nobody is coming.","words":[{"surface":"だれ","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"来","vocabId":"1547710","reading":"らい"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"彼女はだれも好きじゃないです。","romaji":"Kanojo wa daremo suki ja nai desu.","en":"She doesn't like anyone.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だれ","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"好き","vocabId":"1277450","reading":"すき"},{"surface":"じゃ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]},{"jp":"ここにはだれもいないです。","romaji":"Koko ni wa daremo inai desu.","en":"There is nobody here.","words":[{"surface":"ここ","vocabId":"1288810","reading":"ここ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だれ","vocabId":"1416830","reading":"だれ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}]}]}